  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU for Enhanced border security in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action seeks to bolster border management and security in Lebanon, addressing prevalent challenges in the region. It is designed to strengthen the operational capacity of Lebanese stakeholders in response to the current economic crisis and also for sustained effectiveness in the long run by augmenting protection and oversight across all borders, including those on land, sea and airports. Furthermore, it aims to mitigate threats and risks arising from the complex regional landscape. Moreover, the initiative will facilitate synergies with European agencies (among which Frontex and Europol) on border-related matters, fostering community outreach and engagement with civil society to ensure a Human Rights-based approach.</narrative>
  </description>
